    "description": {
      "value": "<p>They'll love your new recipe.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Toxin mixology ability, know at least 1 poison technique</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you brew poisons with the toxin mixology ability, the number of poison points you have to spend increases by +2.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain Toxic Mixologist multiple times. Each time, the required number of known poison techniques increases by +2.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/assassin-feats#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
